COMPILATION OF: E46M1

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M1

   1 a 0000 E46M1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE SHAPE E41X7 REFUSES: TWO literal items in ONE
   4 a 0006      `put file'. The same two items are then PUT on the CONSOLE route
   5 a 0006      in the same object, so the item chain is compared inside ONE
   6 a 0006      compilation instead of across two. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file;
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M1OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A','B');
  10 c 0048   put list('A','B');
  11 c 006A   close file(outf);
  12 a 0070 end E46M1;

CODE SIZE = 0073
DATA AREA = 000B
FREE SYMS = 3887
END  COMPILATION
